-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Rosenberger G</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Verdauungsapparat</article-title><source>Die klinische Untersuchung des Rindes</source><year>1990</year><publisher-name>Dritte Auflage. Verlag Paul Parey, Berlin &#x00026; Hamburg</publisher-name><fpage>288</fpage><lpage>400</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dirksen</surname><given-names>GU</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Control of production disease in dairy cows in a changing agricultural environment</article-title><source>Proceedings, Eight International Conference on Production Diseases in Farm Animals, Berne, Switzerland</source><year>1992</year><fpage>271</fpage><lpage>282</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Franzolin</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Dehority</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of prolonged high-concentrate feeding on ruminal protozoa concentrations</article-title><source>J Anim Sci</source><year>1996</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>2803</fpage><lpage>2809</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8923195</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Goad</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Goad</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagaraja</surname><given-names>TG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ruminal microbial and fermentative changes associated with experimentally induced subacute acidosis in steers</article-title><source>J Anim Sci</source><year>1998</year><volume>76</volume><fpage>234</fpage><lpage>241</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9464904</pub-id></citation></ref><ref 